      "content": "i hear you but i feel like i'm overthinking it. most people take supplements all the time without issues. like, if i just take a lower dose, or maybe just take it every other day, it wouldn't really mess with my hormones as much, right? it's just for my mood, it's not like i'm taking actual antidepressants or anything.",
